{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift fast. Shoot smarter. Survive longer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Drift Survivors</i> is a <strong>top-down arena survival action game</strong> where drifting is your movement skill and your lifeline. Enemies swarm. Your car is your weapon. Keep sliding, keep firing, keep upgrading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/cdd707c7ca489241ab7896298b5d4482.poster.avif?t=1773325125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/cdd707c7ca489241ab7896298b5d4482.webm?t=1773325125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/cdd707c7ca489241ab7896298b5d4482.mp4?t=1773325125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor-style runs</strong> with escalating enemy waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision drifting</strong> for dodges, spacing, and control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car-mounted weapons</strong> like Homing Rockets, Tron Lines, Ricochet Guns, Bombardments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; build choices</strong> to shape every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Japanese-inspired neon arenas</strong> with tight corners and clean lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtracks</strong> built for high tempo runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/3b2c467a195820c71dba5c70f5224a75.poster.avif?t=1773325125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/3b2c467a195820c71dba5c70f5224a75.webm?t=1773325125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399940/extras/3b2c467a195820c71dba5c70f5224a75.mp4?t=1773325125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive as the pressure climbs. Learn the patterns. Find a build that clicks. Then push for a longer run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start the engine. Hit the drift. Become a Drift Survivor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Circle Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940/820ca2abd9219c5a8c960bd41fdec2d74a4899fd.jpg"},{"name":"Square Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940/5a97890c33a680ae44f2a1893b93447950469885.jpg"},{"name":"Pentagon Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940/b2cd8a2828b72d62d2ce64ea7385ea8b25520e71.jpg"},{"name":"Hexagon Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940/0b145e88edd7b1c9c23426d45e169c846849d8bd.jpg"},{"name":"Octagon Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940/621d2e59da95546b090f8015e07927e68f33adb7.jpg"},{"name":"Bronze Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940/25ba6f20e4207017ac86ac01b27c44a3e1de17f3.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940/951e56d0733a971b2b71eab123ee4774e4b8b7b3.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399940